https://t.co/B8CHn19Q5B","url":"https://x.com/lidangzzz/status/2115304942197940452"},{"author_id":"855303666722525184","created_at":"2026-10-28T04:41:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115302801148727583"],"id":"2115302801148727583","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":299,"impression_count":15833,"like_count":290,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":39},"text":"最近发现一个特别适合做「知识可视化」的 Skill：diagram-design。\n\n已经有近 6 万 Stars。\n\n它干的事很简单：\n\n把长文、流程和关系，做成一张专业好看的图表。\n\n对我这种内容创作者来说，主要用在 6 个地方：\n\n01｜给文章配专业插图\n02｜做 PPT 和分享演示的素材\n03｜把长内容压成一张适合传播的图 https://t.co/kyVq93V1ag","url":"https://x.com/wanerfu/status/2115302801148727583"},{"author_id":"55964567","created_at":"2026-10-28T04:39:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115302468422873353"],"id":"2115302468422873353","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":4141,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"清末之时，西方列强、西方媒体确实有欺侮东亚民族的一面，这激起梁启超等士人的反感，激发出国族情感。\n在现代民族国家建构之时，梁开始使用中华民族概念，超然于大清中国之上，这是他的重大贡献。\n但更新的资料显示，中华民族一词，是日本人最先使用的。\n转\n《论中国之将强》\n梁启超\n1897","url":"https://x.com/wuzuolai/status/2115302468422873353"},{"author_id":"28940967","created_at":"2026-10-28T04:33:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115300867364520183"],"id":"2115300867364520183","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":17,"impression_count":23573,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"本质是想把每个agent的session直接自动fork出来，工作完以后再merge进去，\n\n核心是为了一个task执行时带着前一个session得context和整个function calling或者bash结果，\n\n问题是，一个设计合理的agent workflow会自己把这个东西backup出来给别的agent用，这东西绝对不该写进harness里，又笨重又傻逼。 https://t.co/ZBbYfN0K94","url":"https://x.com/lidangzzz/status/2115300867364520183"},{"author_id":"55964567","created_at":"2026-10-28T04:26:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115299103349551166"],"id":"2115299103349551166","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2525,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"在古代中国，华夷之别，华人就是文明人类\n野人、四夷就是不文明人类，\n直到鸦片战争时代，\n大清仍然视英国列强为夷人\n\n现在有海外华人\n对大陆中国人不称华人\n其实是承认海外同胞是文明人类\n而大陆中国人受中共野蛮统治，\n其实已是蛮夷了 https://t.co/6ErRi4MApa","url":"https://x.com/wuzuolai/status/2115299103349551166"},{"author_id":"55964567","created_at":"2026-10-28T04:23:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115298324056343018"],"id":"2115298324056343018","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4669,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"最后一句可以当激将的声音听。\n让那些岁月静好的人，特别是让那些热爱中共统治的人\n还有毛粉们听到，他们做何感受？\n没有人真的希望中国人再受一次文革之苦难，但现在这种状态，增量文革正在发生中，不以海外善良的人或反讽者的意志为转移。 https://t.co/aDqwQVu7M2","url":"https://x.com/wuzuolai/status/2115298324056343018"},{"author_id":"28940967","created_at":"2026-10-28T04:20:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115297543315660849"],"id":"2115297543315660849","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":59386,"like_count":90,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":0},"text":"如果我是蔡康永，我一定不会在台湾问题上打擦边球，企图浑水摸鱼，因为这样只会伤害路人粉的心。\n\n我认为蔡康永应该做的，就是堂堂正正回应网友，“我是中国人，我支持一个中国，我坚定反对台独，中国必将统一，正义终将胜利，邪恶必然垮台”。","url":"https://x.com/lidangzzz/status/2115297543315660849"},{"author_id":"1166950087399837696","created_at":"2026-10-28T04:07:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115294462721286578"],"id":"2115294462721286578","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3435,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"忙了一上午，瞅了一眼股市。\n\n嚯，他又硬起来了。 https://t.co/GeiFuMm7e8","url":"https://x.com/RobinSeun/status/2115294462721286578"},{"author_id":"55964567","created_at":"2026-10-28T04:01:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115292904788984174"],"id":"2115292904788984174","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4251,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我发现,有海外华人之说，没有海内华人之说，\n海外华侨，强调的是华人身份，\n而中国大陆则强调中国人身份，\n是不是@GROK？","url":"https://x.com/wuzuolai/status/2115292904788984174"},{"author_id":"1